@startuml
title 本机演示部署图（AI-辅助）
node "浏览器" {
  artifact "Vue/Vite 开发页" as ui
}
node "Windows 开发主机" {
  node "Java 21 进程" {
    artifact "gateway :18080" as gateway
    artifact "space-service :18081" as space
    artifact "access-service :18082" as access
    artifact "billing-service :18083" as billing
    artifact "pass-service :18084" as pass
    artifact "analytics-service :18085" as analytics
  }
  database "MySQL 8.4 :3306\n五个独立 schema" as mysql
  artifact "Nacos 3.1.1 standalone\n:8848 注册发现与配置 / :8080 控制台" as nacos
}
ui --> gateway : HTTP
gateway --> space
gateway --> access
gateway --> billing
gateway --> pass
gateway --> analytics
gateway ..> nacos : 注册 / lb:// 发现 / 可选配置
space ..> nacos : 注册 / 充电参数刷新
access ..> nacos : 注册 / Feign 发现 / 可选配置
billing ..> nacos : 注册 / 费率参数刷新
pass ..> nacos : 注册 / Feign 发现 / 预约月卡参数刷新
analytics ..> nacos : 注册 / Feign 发现 / 可选配置
space --> mysql
access --> mysql
billing --> mysql
pass --> mysql
analytics --> mysql
note right of nacos
本机联调：六实例健康注册；
网关和跨服务调用已通过。
配置中心可选；离线使用本地兜底值。
Docker Compose 与 Sentinel 未启用。
end note
@enduml
